 Extending

A few natural extensions, in increasing order of difficulty:

1. Add rooms — append entries to `ROOMS[]` and bump `ROOM_COUNT`.
2. Increase history — raise `MAX_MESSAGES` (uses ~50 bytes/message RAM) and consider reading from LittleFS instead of RAM for large histories.
3. Persist users/bans — write `banned[]` and `users[]` to `/users.json` on change, load on boot.
4. WebSocket transport — replace polling with `WebSocketsServer` (library `links2004/arduinoWebSockets`) for lower latency and less HTTP overhead.
5. OTA updates — add `ArduinoOTA` so you can reflash over WiFi instead of USB.
6. Multi-admin — remove the `adminExists()` gate so more than one admin can be connected.



